content":"# Creator Registry and Guidelines

Creators are responsible for proposing operational knowledge as LRNs.

Creator duties:
- observe behavior or problems;
- document the proposed knowledge;
- provide evidence;
- update the proposal as feedback arrives;
- cooperate with validation and governance.

Creator responsibilities do not include sole validation authority over their own proposal.

See `CONTRIBUTING.md` and `LRN_SPEC.md`.

